{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2023-01-09 08:45:00', 'title': 'EV CHARGERS: HOW MANY DO WE NEED?', 'text': 'S&P GLOBAL MOBILITY SPECIAL REPORT EVEN WITH HOME CHARGING, INFRASTRUCTURE WILL NEED TO QUADRUPLE BY 2025 SOUTHFIELD, MICH. , JAN. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SUPPORTERS OF VEHICLE ELECTRIFICATION POINT TO THE MORE THAN 140,000 EV CHARGING STATIONS CURRENTLY DEPLOYED ACROSS THE UNITED STATES – INCLUDING LEVEL 2 AC AND LEVEL 3 DC FAST CHARGERS AND BOTH PUBLIC AND RESTRICTED ACCESS UNITS – AS A SIGN THAT A BUDDING SYSTEM TO SUPPORT OUR TRANSPORTATION TRANSFORMATION IS IN PLACE.'}